### Variables
# Local API needs `npx vercel dev` in vite-app (port 3000).
# `npm run dev` alone (5173) does NOT serve /api → connection rejected / SPA HTML.
# Prod: Reutlingen VPN required (firewall only allows 134.103.92.135 for /api).
@local = http://localhost:3000
@prod = https://twitter-web-inky.vercel.app
@baseUrl = {{local}}
# For production tests: set @baseUrl = {{prod}} and connect VPN first.

@postId = b4c13d40-011e-4367-aadd-35bf758412f2
@commentId1 = b44da884-8a1b-4bee-942a-1027bc7e2b2e
@commentId2 = 3393ce10-9747-40ce-989d-07d871665d3f
@commentId3 = a0e34d46-59a5-4d36-a115-8e0ea36e233f
@avatarId = avatar_female_german_01

### List posts (grouped) + publish history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Accept: application/json

### Publish post (create) — with avatarId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "post": {
    "id": "{{postId}}",
    "text": "Hallo Hochschule Reutlingen!",
    "likeCount": 0,
    "comments": [],
    "avatarId": "{{avatarId}}"
  }
}

### Publish post — full document with comments + likes
# Same post.id = append; newest snapshot wins for the feed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "post": {
    "id": "{{postId}}",
    "text": "dhufupidfhuaehdf",
    "likeCount": 12,
    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "{{commentId1}}",
        "text": "dafgfgdfgfgfdfgfgdfg",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-27T14:22:05"
      },
      {
        "id": "{{commentId2}}",
        "text": "dagffg",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-27T14:22:07"
      },
      {
        "id": "{{commentId3}}",
        "text": "dagfgadf",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-27T14:22:08"
      }
    ],
    "avatarId": "{{avatarId}}"
  }
}

### Publish post — random author (omit avatarId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "post": {
    "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "text": "Post without avatarId — server picks random memoji",
    "likeCount": 0,
    "comments": []
  }
}

### CORS preflight (OPTIONS)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/post
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### Prod: list posts
# Switch: set @baseUrl = {{prod}} above, or send this request as-is
GET {{prod}}/api/posts
Accept: application/json

### Prod: publish with comments
POST {{prod}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "post": {
    "id": "{{postId}}",
    "text": "dhufupidfhuaehdf",
    "likeCount": 12,
    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "{{commentId1}}",
        "text": "dafgfgdfgfgfdfgfgdfg",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-27T14:22:05"
      },
      {
        "id": "{{commentId2}}",
        "text": "dagffg",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-27T14:22:07"
      },
      {
        "id": "{{commentId3}}",
        "text": "dagfgadf",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-27T14:22:08"
      }
    ],
    "avatarId": "{{avatarId}}"
  }
}
